        "original_id": "fc6efc61-a690-5aef-9143-c5c60c50fb0c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carrie Akre, Shifty Shellshock, Seth Brooks Binzer, Chris Friel, Danny Newcomb, Mike McCready, Rick Friel\n- Bands: Hammerbox, Goodness, Crazy Town, The Rockfords, Pearl Jam, Jodie Watts\n- Places: Seattle, Washington\n- Topics: American musicians, band formation\n\nFacts:\n- Carrie Akre was born on September 24, 1966, and she is an American musician.\n- Shifty Shellshock was born as Seth Brooks Binzer on August 23, 1974, and he is an American music artist.\n- Carrie Akre is best known for her work with the Seattle underground bands Hammerbox and Goodness.\n- Shifty Shellshock is best known as a co-founder and front man of the rap rock band Crazy Town and for the band's hit song \"Butterfly.\"\n- The Rockfords were an American rock band formed in Seattle, Washington, in 1999.\n- The Rockfords were formed by Carrie Akre, Chris Friel, and Danny Newcomb of Goodness, Mike McCready of Pearl Jam, and Rick Friel of Jodie Watts.",
